I am in my everyday bus.
I get down at a big junction.
It is very crowded outside.
Where is my other bus stop?
I do not know anything.
There is a fruit shop on the street there.
I go towards that fruit vendor.
I ask, "Dada, where is the Marine Drive bus stop?"
Dada smiles and tells me the way.
"Madam, go straight ahead from here," he says.
"Then turn left from there."
"There is a big intersection ahead."
"Go towards that big intersection."
"That new bus stop is right there."
I thank him.
First I walk straight.
Then I turn left.
I see that big intersection ahead.
I go towards that intersection.
My other bus stop is there.
